    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "This is GPS, the Global Public Square. Welcome to all of you in the United States and around the world. I'm Farid Zakaria. We'll start today's program with the 2016 Democratic nominee for President Hillary Rodham Clinton. I'll ask her about the political battles in America.",
