        "confidence": 0.98
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker is welcoming viewers in the United States and around the world.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "Today's program will begin with Hillary Rodham Clinton, the 2016 Democratic nominee for President.",
